  "description": "Change of Use\nSingle Dwelling(C3) to Children Home(C2) For upto 2 Children \n",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0cm;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;Insufficient information has been provided to demonstrate an identified local need for the proposed facility or that it would serve the local community. In addition, no legal agreement has been secured to guarantee priority placements for children within the London Borough of Harrow, meaning the development would not ensure that local childcare needs are met. The proposal therefore represents an inappropriate change of use, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy H12 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies GR1 and HO7 of Harrow Local Plan (2021 - 2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal results in the loss of existing C3 residential floorspace, and no justification or reprovision has been provided to demonstrate that this loss is acceptable. The development would therefore lead to an unwarranted reduction in the borough’s housing stock, contrary to the Policies H7 and H8 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies H02 and H07 of the Harrow Local Plan 2021 – 2041 (2026).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
